# `genesis/data/rakia` — observed capacity governance

`compute-capacity.json` is promoted by the cluster steward from a read-only observation snapshot.
The EPR binding connects that operational projection to the same governance contract that evaluates
`deployments.json`, so changing either side recomputes the relationship instead of trusting a stale
derived total.
